        "b": 327.904541015625
      },
      "markdown": "|   1 | Condensate inlet          |\n|-----|---------------------------|\n|   2 | Foam cover                |\n|   3 | Oleophilic filter         |\n|   4 | Service drains with valve |\n|   5 | Air injection connection  |\n|   6 | OGC filter                |\n|   7 | Activated carbon filter   |\n|   8 | Condensate test outlet    |\n|   9 | Condensate outlet         |",
      "rows": 9,
      "cols": 2,
      "section_id": "sec_auto_745",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_4",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
